1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,300
Why is it so hard to change a habit, even one you want to change?

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,967
Each time we repeat a behavior, it can feel a little easier, until it's almost automatic.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:15,600
A new behavior takes a different route. At first, it needs more attention, and effort.

4
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,700
But with practice, that new route can become familiar too.
